                    {
                        "sense_id": "f329b299-56c1-3312-b659-9d0d0c1dc4e5",
                        "entry_id": "aa8f760c-2827-3ac5-b2cf-dc2e08851511",
                        "glosses": [
                            "肯定，當然 表示肯定，確定的語氣助詞，但一般語氣比較弱"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "408ad8fe-4e1a-4b90-bba9-43288b3d9690",
                                "sense_id": "f329b299-56c1-3312-b659-9d0d0c1dc4e5",
                                "text": "Straks komen we nog te laat! — Nee hoor, we hebben nog genoeg tijd.",
                                "translation": "我們要晚到了！ — 肯定不會，我們還有大把時間。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10be6172-066d-4104-80c5-766300836c4a",
                                "sense_id": "f329b299-56c1-3312-b659-9d0d0c1dc4e5",
                                "text": "Wilt u het bonnetje? — Nee hoor, bedankt.",
                                "translation": "您需要收據嗎？ — 不用了，謝謝。"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed7b366a-d596-33ef-8f99-61b572c48cfc",
                        "entry_id": "aa8f760c-2827-3ac5-b2cf-dc2e08851511",
                        "glosses": [
                            "語氣助詞，表示對先前表述的否定： 儘管如此，但是，然而"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "82a3813d-f65c-427b-a449-6a16130c2883",
                                "sense_id": "ed7b366a-d596-33ef-8f99-61b572c48cfc",
                                "text": "De kou valt best mee. — Nou, ik vind het toch wel koud hoor!",
                                "translation": "也沒那麼冷嘛。 — 呃，但我還是覺得很冷！"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
